 across, so we had to go an\n                  extra 50 miles to the new one.\n\n\n                Put even or only in the most appropriate place in each sentence.\n                1 Ben offered to let me stay with him while | was in Glasgow, and                  Offered\n                  to pick me up from the station.\n                                           be in my office on Monday next week as I’m going to Poland for a\n                  business meeting on Tuesday.\n                3 Every penny the charity raises helps the homeless, and..................... the smallest donation\n                            CaN Make a vital difference.\n                4 Jan seems to have invited everyone to the party.         AAS           asked Ann, and\n                  they haven't spoken to each other for years.\n                            LOUIS          knew where the keys were kept, and nobody else.\n               6  | don’t get home from work until late,                    COOK at the weekend.\n\n\n                                                                                                            155", "char_count": 3063, "mean_conf": 87.67, "word_count": 451, "words": [{"text": "Exercises", "x0": 173, "y0": 72, "x1": 491, "y1": 134, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "Cross", "x0": 309, "y0": 205, "x1": 407, "y1": 236, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "out", "x0": 418, "y0": 209, "x1": 479, "y1": 236, "conf": 96, "bold": true}, {"text": "any", "x0": 490, "y0": 214, "x1": 554, "y1": 245, "conf": 96, "bold": true}, {"text": "incorrect", "x0": 566, "y0": 206, "x1": 727, "y1": 237, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "answers.", "x0": 738, "y0": 215, "x1": 893, "y1": 237, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "©}", "x0": 904, "y0": 198, "x1": 966, "y1": 249, "conf": 41, "bold": false}, {"text": "We", "x0": 355, "y0": 270, "x1": 411, "y1": 299, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "very", "x0": 423, "y0": 270, "x1": 520, "y1": 309, "conf": 91, "bold":